argv: ["<ENV_ROOT>\\Scripts\\python.exe", "-m", "jev.eval_replay", "--help"]
usage: eval_replay.py [-h] --split {cal,dev,ood,test} --out OUT
                      [--limit LIMIT] [--stride STRIDE] [--estimate-only]
                      [--confirm-window] [--exclusive] [--deadline DEADLINE]
                      [--identity IDENTITY] [--base BASE]

options:
